 14(3), 15(1) and 21(3); (e) list the positions and corporations, trade or professional associations and trade unions disclosed under paragraph 21(1)(e); and (f) list any trusts disclosed under paragraph 21(1)(b.1). Mike Kelloway · Member of Parliament Declaration type Disclosure Summaries (Code) Disclosure date October 3, 2025 Regime Conflict of Interest Code for Members of the House of Commons Description LiabilitiesCar loan with Cape Breton Credit Union Ltd., jointly held with spouseSpouse's/Common-Law Partner's source(s) of incomeNext 12 months: Employment income from the Government of Canada.Last 12 months: Employment income from the Government of Canada. Disclosed on October 3, 2025","url":"https://www.ethicscanada.ca/en/public-registry/Details?declarationId=e0c4f9aa-19c1-4be9-863c-172095fd9d15"}],"other":[]},"lobbying":{"total":329,"first":"2020-02-04","last":"2026-10-08","byYear":{"2020":21,"2021":27,"2022":61,"2023":47,"2024":60,"2025":49,"2026":64},"topSubjects":[["Fisheries",64],["Economic Development",57],["Environment",46],["Energy",42],["Climate",33],["Health",26],["Aboriginal Affairs",25],["Industry",22]],"topOrgs":[["Irving Shipbuilding Inc.",9],["Nova Scotia Power Incorporated",9],["fisheries council of canada",8],["The Canadian Committee for a Sustainable Eel Fishery (CCSEF)",8],["CANADIAN CANCER SOCIETY",7],["United Fisheries Conservation Alliance",7],["Maritime Launch Services Ltd",7],["Pieridae Energy Limited",6]]}}